    "title": "Rosie's Cafe to return under new ownership - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jill Callison ,\n7 hours ago Rosie’s Cafe is coming back — and so is the bread pudding. The old-school cafe, which operated on West Madison Street for more than 40 years under two generations of ownership, will reopen in early December with a new owner. Longtime friends Tom Hinrichs and Barry Selland describe... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 11",
